text:
When the forecast says deep freeze, I reach for bold flavours. Kimchi-Tomato Soup with Rice and Soft Egg is tangy, savoury, and softly spicy, with rice-thickened broth and a jammy egg on top. Pure cozy energy.
@alisoneroman - Something from Nothing.

#kimchisoup #cozykitchen #food  #foodsky🍜🍽️
